WEBVTT

52:34.726 --> 52:35.726
That's very funny, Buzz.

52:35.811 --> 52:38.896
-This is serious!
-Hey, Woody! Where'd ya go?

52:38.980 --> 52:41.065
He's lying. Buzz ain't there.

52:41.691 --> 52:43.859
Oh! Hi, Buzz!

52:43.944 --> 52:47.029
Why don't you say hello
to the guys over there?

52:47.113 --> 52:50.825
Hiya, fellas!
To infinity and beyond!

52:50.909 --> 52:52.701
Hey, look! It's Buzz!

52:52.786 --> 52:57.706
Hey, Buzz, let's show the guys
our new secret best friends handshake.

52:57.791 --> 52:59.124
Give me five, man!

52:59.209 --> 53:00.376
Something's screwy here.
